OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands facing 'hottest
OL,4,Aever summer'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's mean temperature over the
OL,7,Fsame period, and with two weeks of
OL,8,Fsummer to go, is 19.2B0C (66.56F), some
OL,9,F3C (5.4F) above the average,
OL,10,Fmeteorologists said.
OL,12,FIt was in line with evidence that
OL,13,Fclimate change was driving hotter
OL,14,Fsummers and increasing the likelihood
OL,15,Fof drier conditions, they added.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
